# ⚠️ THIS REPO IS PUBLIC AND GitHub Pages SERVES ITS ROOT, so anything committed
# here is world-readable at a guessable URL. `wrangler-account.json` carries the
# Cloudflare account identity and must never land in it. The Cloudflare Pages
# deploy uploads a staged copy of 13 named files, so ignoring these costs the
# site nothing.
.wrangler/
.claude/*

# Exception to the line above: vendored agent skills are public source under
# a permissive licence, so being readable at a guessable address costs nothing.
# Everything else under .claude/ stays ignored for the reason stated above.
!.claude/skills/

# The dispatch capture. Never commit it again: it left the repository and the
# history on 2026-09-29 on purpose. Working copy lives outside the repo.
data/dispatch-events.csv
